<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Colep studies Polish move.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Colep studies Polish move.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese metal packaging group Colep Portugal-Embalagens Produtos, Enchimentos e Equipamentos is studying investing in Poland with a final decision due by October, managing director Jorge Ribeiro said.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that the investment could total 1.5 billion escudos ($8 million), depending on whether a new factory needed to be built or an old one adapted.</p>
<p>---Paula Cordeiro, Lisboa Editorial, 351-1-3113125. ($ = 185.3 Portugese Escudos)</p>
</text>
